  storyLines:
  - 'Player: Wait...! What happens to the ground? It''s collapsing!'
  - 'Player: This land now is a combination of forest, beach, and autumn. How is
    this even possible?'
  - 'Player: At least my house is still standing...'
  - 'Player: Wait...I saw those creatures before, Mage, Merman King, and...'
  - 'Player: So this is it, invading again...now they are all coming back.'
  - 'Mage: This time...You are not going anywhere!'
  - 'Merman King: I couldn''t take the island last time, I will get this land from
    you then...'
  - 'Golem: The land! It belongs to me.'
  - 'Bomb Goblin: I want to bomb more! This place will be bombed! Let''s play!'
  - 'Big Turtle: There is no water here, what happened.'
  - 'Worm: The land is not yours.'
  - 'Player: I''m the strongest, YOU CAN''T DEFEAT ME!'
